1
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,990
- Checkmate.
- Aaarggh!

2
00:00:31,489 --> 00:00:32,569
(Leonard:)Again?

3
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:35,741
(Sheldon:)Obviously, you're not well suited
for three-dimensional chess.

4
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:39,250
Perhaps three-dimensional Candy Land
would be more your speed.

5
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,079
(Leonard:)Just reset the board.

6
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:45,299
(Sheldon:)It must be humbling to suck
on so many different levels.

7
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:51,134
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

8
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,341
- Hey, guys.
- Hey.

9
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:54,800
- Get my mail?
- Yeah, right here.

10
00:00:54,971 --> 00:01:04,021
(Leonard:)- How was Nebraska?
- Well, better than North Dakota.

